                    {
                        "sense_id": "a4ee7eac-b109-399b-b278-9f0a532d4164",
                        "entry_id": "f43d3fb3-117f-3b7a-aa58-94d4e265e046",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A door, window, shutter, or divider consisting of two equal panels hinged together so that it opens by folding the panels against each other."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "61dbaa8b-1382-4c4a-8995-acfd38bbee73",
                                "sense_id": "a4ee7eac-b109-399b-b278-9f0a532d4164",
                                "text": "Wood-finished insulative shutters set as bifolds at the window."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "eae3b5df-1afc-479d-9038-33e98fd00ac4",
                                "sense_id": "a4ee7eac-b109-399b-b278-9f0a532d4164",
                                "text": "The doors to the left were bifolds and opened into a long living room."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "192af219-cada-4b8e-b92e-7b9b4382df3d",
                                "sense_id": "a4ee7eac-b109-399b-b278-9f0a532d4164",
                                "text": "Although bifolds are typically sold in kits where the doors are already hinged together, they're a little fussier than sliders or twins."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1dc5ec96-3c2b-45f1-be22-b18c4fd7c2c9",
                                "sense_id": "a4ee7eac-b109-399b-b278-9f0a532d4164",
                                "text": "The wall facing the ocean was all glass and could be folded back in sections, bifolds, to almost completely have no wall at all, just a fulllength balcony and the ocean."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "73aa7659-6479-3b97-b57a-eac3ed9daf22",
                        "entry_id": "f43d3fb3-117f-3b7a-aa58-94d4e265e046",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A sheet of paper or cardboard folded in half along a crease down the center."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "33994093-0bc9-40e8-a04d-f5ec72370cca",
                                "sense_id": "73aa7659-6479-3b97-b57a-eac3ed9daf22",
                                "text": "AFSl is made up of thirteen bifolds, or fifty-two pages (each unfolded folio measuring 13.5 x 21 inches), beginning with the title page and continuing for fifty-one numbered pages."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "300ffbf8-cafa-43b2-8bc1-d86e5667fbd4",
                                "sense_id": "73aa7659-6479-3b97-b57a-eac3ed9daf22",
                                "text": "Anonymous Public Library Director \"[We use our] website, calendar of events, bifolds for teens and children, school visits (playing book bingo), PR in newspapers and on county cable channel."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "53efb572-6b75-4dd0-bda3-5cc6e37d0b0e",
                                "sense_id": "73aa7659-6479-3b97-b57a-eac3ed9daf22",
                                "text": "Cards, bifolds and trifolds with information on public finances, debt, municipal finances, and other economic issues."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ef3e3424-4265-3e17-9705-bf702e008a25",
                        "entry_id": "f43d3fb3-117f-3b7a-aa58-94d4e265e046",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A wallet, billfold, or carrying case with a single fold, so that it opens like a book."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2dfed961-1de5-4fa8-90ba-f927eafb8f06",
                                "sense_id": "ef3e3424-4265-3e17-9705-bf702e008a25",
                                "text": "A 1996 survey showed that men under age 20 buy three times as many trifolds as bifolds. So a trifold wallet becomes a habit, even after it has expanded to the size and shape of a jumbo bar of soap."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fcb13cfd-2e43-4fc1-9916-329dd68a1a29",
                                "sense_id": "ef3e3424-4265-3e17-9705-bf702e008a25",
                                "text": "Simultaneously, Simon and Pat pulled black leather covered identification bifolds from their breast pockets and let the back flap fall down."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c5e1a28d-067f-4d09-8911-0f4928c06b1f",
                                "sense_id": "ef3e3424-4265-3e17-9705-bf702e008a25",
                                "text": "Alec and Rob handed her their leather bifolds containing their picture identification with their badges pinned inside."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0027d0c9-117e-3e65-b3a1-0057773c1cf9",
                        "entry_id": "f43d3fb3-117f-3b7a-aa58-94d4e265e046",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A crease or turn that causes something to double back on itself."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b3aea314-e4aa-4482-b8fa-5ed985fc9680",
                                "sense_id": "0027d0c9-117e-3e65-b3a1-0057773c1cf9",
                                "text": "I want to learn how to play, and that's all puzzles and problems, and what do I care when I go to play a game about parallels and bifolds?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a3d9aab0-0496-4cd3-ac4b-66dadf135540",
                                "sense_id": "0027d0c9-117e-3e65-b3a1-0057773c1cf9",
                                "text": "...in porous beds, which are known as reservoir beds, which are usually sandstones or porous limestones, trapped there usually, not always, under bifolds in the rocks or arches in the rocks known as anteclines, and nearly all oil, not all oil, but nearly all oil wells are found where such reservoir beds are drilled into on the top of such anteclines."
                            }
                        ]
